<head>
<title>PGMIMG: Importing and exporting between PGM/PPM formats (Meteosat, etc) and MiraMon</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>
<body>
<!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

<p>This application allows to import and export the binary versions of the PGM and PPM formats. For ASCII versions of PGM use ASCIIIMG or contact with  <a href="mailto:suport@miramon.uab.cat">suport@miramon.uab.cat</a>. The importation or exportation of PBM files has not been implemented.</p>

<P>PGM or PPM formats have a small ASCII heading, previous to the image, that can be either on ASCII format or binary. Essentially the PGM formats, on greyscale, and PPM formats, on true color, can be distinguished.</p>

<P>For greyscale formats, supported data are byte type, integer or long. In the case that the file is truncated, the destination image is filled with 0 in order to be opened with MiraMon.</p>

<!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpsopcions"/>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

